#. Tag: title
#: global-settings.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Global &kppp; settings"
msgstr "Globalne  &kppp; postavke"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "The changes made here affect all accounts you have set up in &kppp;"
msgstr ""
"Promjene koje ovdje napravite bi mogle uticati na sve račune koje ste "
"postavili u &kppp;"

#. Tag: title
#: global-settings.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Accounts tab"
msgstr "Kartice računa"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: global-settings.docbook:10
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The <guilabel>Accounts</guilabel> tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Kartice <guilabel>računa</guilabel> </screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: global-settings.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The <guilabel>Accounts</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Kartice <guilabel>računa</guilabel> tab</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The <guilabel>Accounts</guilabel> tab</para>"
msgstr "<para>Kartice <guilabel>računa</guilabel></para>"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this dialog, you can manage the accounts themselves. The names of the "
"accounts appear in a list on the left of the dialog."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete upravljati vašim računima. Imena računa data su u listi lijevo."

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To delete an account, select the <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button. You "
"will be asked to confirm before the account is finally deleted."
msgstr ""
"Kako biste obrisali ovaj račun, izaberite <guibutton>Obriši</guibutton> "
"dugme. Od Vas će se tražiti da potvrdite prije nego što račun bude trajno "
"obrisan."

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can make a copy of an account with the <guibutton>Copy</guibutton> "
"button. You could use this for example, to separate different users in the "
"family, although that would normally be better done by having them be "
"different users in the OS as well! Or perhaps you just have more than one "
"account with the same <acronym>ISP</acronym> and wish to use both of them."
msgstr ""
"Možete napraviti kopiju računa birajući opciju <guibutton>Kopiraj</"
"guibutton>. Na primjer, to možete koristiti ukoliko želite razvojiti "
"korisnike unutar porodice, obzirom da bi bilo bolje da svako ima svoj "
"korisnički račun OS-a. Ili možda jednostavno imate više od jednog računa sa "
"istim <acronym>ISP</acronym> i želite oba koristiti."

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choosing <guibutton>Edit...</guibutton> will take you to the dialog "
"described in <link linkend=\"dialog-setup\">Dialog Setup</link>, but with "
"the selected accounts details."
msgstr ""
"Opcija <guibutton>Izmijeni...</guibutton> će vas proslijediti u dijaloški "
"prozor opisan u <link linkend=\"dialog-setup\">Uređivanje dijaloškog "
"prozora</link>, ali sa označenim detaljima računa."

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choosing <guibutton>New...</guibutton> will offer you the choice between the "
"<link linkend=\"wizard\">Wizard</link> or the <link linkend=\"dialog-setup"
"\">Dialog Setup</link> already described."
msgstr ""
"Opcija <guibutton>Novo...</guibutton> će vam ponuditi izbor između  <link "
"linkend=\"wizard\">Čarobnjak</link>a i <link linkend=\"dialog-setup"
"\">Uređivanje dijaloškog prozora</link> koji su već opisani."

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you select an account, and you have turned on <link linkend=\"account-"
"accounting\">accounting</link> then the accumulated information for that "
"account will appear in the two panels labelled <guilabel>Phone Costs:</"
"guilabel> and <guilabel>Volume:</guilabel> respectively."
msgstr ""
"Ako odaberete račun i uključili ste <link linkend=\"account-accounting"
"\">vođenje računa</link> tada će se akumulirane informacije za taj račun "
"prikazati u dvije liste označene kao <guilabel>Telefonski Troškovi:</"
"guilabel> i <guilabel>Sadržaj:</guilabel> respektivno."

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To the left of the accounting display, are two buttons: <guibutton>Reset...</"
"guibutton> and <guibutton>View Logs</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Lijevo od prikaza vođenja računa, nalaze se dvije opcije: <guibutton>Ponovo "
"postavi...</guibutton> i <guibutton>Pogledaj prijave</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pressing <guibutton>Reset...</guibutton> will reset the <guilabel>Phone "
"Costs:</guilabel> and <guilabel>Volume:</guilabel> information to 0. You "
"would typically want to do this once a month or quarter, when you have "
"received your phone bill and reconciled the telephone costs. You can reset "
"either independently, and are offered the choice of which item you want to "
"reset, when you press the <guibutton>Reset</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Opcija <guibutton>Ponovo postavi...</guibutton> će promijeniti postavke "
"<guilabel>Telefonski Troškovi:</guilabel> and <guilabel>Glasnoća:</"
"guilabel>  na 0.  Vjerovatno ćete to htjeti koristiti jednom mjesečno ili "
"jednom u tri mjeseca, kada primite telefonski račun i izmirite troškove. "
"Možete sami koristiti ponovo postavljanje, tako što će vam biti ponuđeno da "
"izaberete šta sve želite ponovo postaviti, kada odaberete opciju "
"<guibutton>Ponovo postavi</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pressing <guibutton>View Logs</guibutton> will open another window, where a "
"log of all the calls made with &kppp; will be displayed. If you have kept "
"logs, you can move forward and backward, in monthly steps. This might be "
"useful if you have received an abnormally large phone bill and are "
"investigating why!"
msgstr ""
"Odabir opcije <guibutton>Pogledaj Prijave</guibutton> će otvoriti novi "
"prozor, gdje će biti prikazana lista svih poziva koji su napravljeni sa "
"&kppp;. Ako ste sačuvali liste, možete se kretati naprijed i nazad, na liste "
"mjeseci. Ovo može biti korisno ukoliko ste primili nenormalno veliki "
"telefonski račun i istražujete razloge."

#. Tag: title
#: global-settings.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Modems tab"
msgstr "Kartica Modema"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tab displays all configured modems and allows you to add, edit, copy "
"and delete modems."
msgstr ""
"Ova kartica će prikazati sve konfigurirane modeme i omogućiti vam da dodate, "
"uredite, kopirate i izbrišete modeme."

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on <guibutton>New</guibutton> or <guibutton>Edit</guibutton> opens the "
"next dialog."
msgstr ""
"Klik na <guibutton>Novo</guibutton> ili <guibutton>Uredi</guibutton> otvara "
"novi dijaloški prozor."

#. Tag: title
#: global-settings.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Device tab"
msgstr "Kartica Uređaja"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: global-settings.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The <guilabel>Device</guilabel> tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Kartica <guilabel>Uređaja</guilabel> </screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: global-settings.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The <guilabel>Device</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Kartica <guilabel>Uređaja</guilabel> </phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The <guilabel>Device</guilabel> tab</para>"
msgstr "<para>Kartica <guilabel>Uređaja</guilabel> </para>"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you can select and configure your modem."
msgstr "Ovdje možete odabrati i podesiti modem."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modem Device"
msgstr "Modem"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choose the device appropriate for your hardware."
msgstr "Izaberite modem koji je prikladan za vaš tvrdi disk."

#. Tag: filename
#: global-settings.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "/dev/ttys0"
msgstr "/dev/ttys0"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"DOS or &Windows; users will know this as COM1, while COM2 is <filename>/dev/"
"ttys1</filename> and so on. These devices are the ones normally used on "
"&Linux; systems."
msgstr ""
"DOS ili &Windows; korisnici će poznavati ovo kao COM1, dok je COM2 "
"<filename>/dev/ttys1</filename> i tako dalje. Ovi uređaji su tipični za "
"korištenje na &Linux; sistemu."

#. Tag: filename
#: global-settings.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "/dev/cua0"
msgstr "/dev/cua0"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first serial line (COM1). COM2 is usually <filename>/dev/cua1</filename> "
"and so on. These devices are commonly used on BSD systems, namely FreeBSD, "
"NetBSD and OpenBSD. Older &Linux; systems may also have these, although on "
"&Linux; they were renamed some time ago to <filename>/dev/"
"ttyS<replaceable>x</replaceable></filename>."
msgstr ""
"Prva serijski linija (COM1). COM2 je obično <filename>/dev/cua1</filename> i "
"tako dalje. Ovi uređaji se uobičajeno koriste na BSD sistemima, kao što su "
"FreeBSD, NetBSD and OpenBSD. Stariji &Linux; ih mogu također imati, mada su "
"na &Linux;u oni prije neko vrijeme preimenovani  na <filename>/dev/"
"ttyS<replaceable>x</replaceable></filename>."

#. Tag: filename
#: global-settings.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "/dev/ttyI0"
msgstr "/dev/ttyI0"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On &Linux; these belong to internal <acronym>ISDN</acronym> cards. These "
"devices emulate a common Hayes compatible modem. <filename>/dev/ttyI0</"
"filename> is for the first, <filename>/dev/ttyI1</filename> is for the "
"second <acronym>ISDN</acronym> card and so on. These devices are only "
"available in the &Linux; version."
msgstr ""
"Na &Linux;u pripadaju internim <acronym>ISDN</acronym> karticama. Ovi "
"uređaji imitiraju zajednički Hayes kompatibilni modem. <filename>/dev/ttyI0</"
"filename> je za prvu, <filename>/dev/ttyI1</filename> je za drugu "
"<acronym>ISDN</acronym> karticu i tako dalje.Ovi uređaji su dostupni jedino "
"na &Linux; verziji."

#. Tag: filename
#: global-settings.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "/dev/modem"
msgstr "/dev/modem"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many &Linux; distributions make a symbolic link from the real modem device "
"to <filename class=\"symlink\">/dev/modem</filename>. <emphasis>You should "
"avoid using this one.</emphasis>. Use the real device that it is pointing to "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Mnoge &Linux; distribucije prave simboličnu poveznicu od pravog modem "
"uređaja na <filename class=\"symlink\">/dev/modem</filename>. "
"<emphasis>Trebali biste izbjegavati da ih koristite</emphasis>. Umjesto toga "
"koristite pravi uređaj."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "Flow Control"
msgstr "Kontrola protoka"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select from Hardware (CRTSCTS), Software (XON/XOFF) and no flow control. The "
"recommended setting is Hardware flow control."
msgstr ""
"Odaberi sa hardvera  (CRTSCTS), softvera ili kontrole protoka. Preporučene "
"postavke su hardverska kontrola protoka."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "Line Termination"
msgstr "Završetak linije"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the correct <quote>Enter</quote> character sequence for your modem. "
"Most modems will use <quote>CR/LF</quote>, however some modems need a "
"different setting. If you experience trouble while running a login script, "
"play with this parameter."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite korektan slijed znakova za <quote>Ulaz</quote>  za Vaš modem. "
"Najčešće modem koristi <quote>CR/LF</quote>, ali neki modemi trebaju "
"drugačije postavke. Ako imate problema sa prijavom, koristite ovaj parametar."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Connection Speed"
msgstr "Brzina veze"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose from the list of connection speeds supported by your serial port. "
"Note that the serial port supports much higher speeds than your modem in "
"most cases. You should probably start with the highest number available, and "
"only reduce it if you have connection problems."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite sa liste brzine veze podržane od strane Vašeg serijskog ulaza. "
"Imajte na umu da serijski ulaz najčešće podržava mnogo veće brzine od "
"modema. Preporučujemo da počnete sa najvećom mogućom vrijednosti, pa je "
"potom reducirate ukoliko imate problema sa vezom."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use Lock File"
msgstr "Koristi zaključavanje datoteke"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Activate this option if you want &kppp; to create a lockfile. Under &Linux; "
"the folder for such a file will be <filename class=\"directory\">/var/lock</"
"filename>. Programs such as <application>mgetty</application> depend on the "
"existence of such lock files, and &kppp; will not work with "
"<application>mgetty</application> if the lock file is not set. Make sure "
"that you don't use the option <option>lock</option> for <application>pppd</"
"application> if you want &kppp; to lock the modem, since the "
"<application>pppd</application> option <option>lock</option> will induce "
"<application>pppd</application> to try to lock the modem device. Since "
"&kppp; will have already locked the device, <application>pppd</application> "
"will fail, and &kppp; will display the error <errorname>pppd died "
"unexpectedly</errorname>."
msgstr ""
"Aktivirajte ovu opciju ukoliko želite da &kppp; kreira zaključanu datoteku. "
"Na &Linux;  mapa za takav dokument će biti <filename class=\"directory\">/"
"var/lock</filename>. Programi poput <application>mgetty</application> ovise "
"o postojanju takvih zaključanih datoteka i &kppp; neće raditi sa  "
"<application>mgetty</application>  ukoliko zaključana datoteka nije "
"postavljena. Budite sigurni da ne koristite <option>zaključaj</option> "
"opciju za <application>pppd</application> ukoliko želite da &kppp; zaključa "
"modem, obzirom da će <application>pppd</application> opcija  "
"<option>zaključaj</option> izazvati da <application>pppd</application> "
"pokuša zaključati uređaj. Obzirom da će &kppp; već zaključati uređaj, "
"<application>pppd</application> će imati grešku i &kppp; će prikazati poruku "
"greške <errorname>pppd died unexpectedly</errorname>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modem Timeout"
msgstr "Pauza modema"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the time in seconds that &kppp; will wait for the "
"<returnvalue>CONNECT</returnvalue> response from your modem. A setting of "
"about 30 seconds should be sufficient for most purposes."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je vrijeme u sekundama koje će &kppp; čekati znak "
"<returnvalue>POVEZIVANJE</returnvalue> od modema. Postavka od oko 30 sekundi "
"bi trebala biti dovoljna za većinu namjena."

#. Tag: title
#: global-settings.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Modem tab"
msgstr "Kartica modema"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: global-settings.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The <guilabel>Modem</guilabel> tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo> <guilabel>Modem</guilabel> kartica</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: global-settings.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The <guilabel>Modem</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase> <guilabel>Modem</guilabel> kartica</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The <guilabel>Modem</guilabel> tab</para>"
msgstr "<para> <guilabel>Modem</guilabel> kartica</para>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "Busy Wait"
msgstr "Zauzeto čekanje"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the length of time the modem should wait before redialing, after it "
"has received a busy signal. Note there are requirements by telecom providers "
"in some countries, which ask you to not set this too low."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je dužina čekanja modema prije nego pokuša ponovo uspostaviti vezu, "
"nakon što je primio signal zauzeća. Imajte na umu da telekom provajderi u "
"nekim državama preporučuju da ovo ne postavljate previše kratko."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modem volume"
msgstr "Glasnoća modema"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the slider to set the modem volume. Left is low volume, center is medium "
"volume, and right is high volume. On some modems, low volume is the same as "
"turning the volume off, and on other modems, medium and high are effectively "
"the same thing."
msgstr ""
"Koristite klizač da podesite glasnoću modema. Lijevo je tiho, centar je "
"srednje glasno i desno je veoma glasno. Na nekim modemima, postavljanje "
"zvuka na tiho je isto kao gašenje zvuka, a na nekim modemima je srednje "
"glasno i glasno efektivno isto."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: global-settings.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modem Commands"
msgstr "Komande modema"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this dialog you can fill in any particular commands appropriate for your "
"modem. If you own a Hayes compatible modem, you most likely won't need to "
"change any of the defaults, but you are encouraged to read the <link linkend="
"\"appendix-hayes-commands\">Hayes Commands</link> Appendix in this help "
"file. The information supplied there can be very helpful in cases where you "
"experience trouble setting up a stable connection with your <acronym>ISP</"
"acronym>'s modems. In particular the two settings for <guilabel>Pre-Init "
"Delay</guilabel> and for <guilabel>Post-Init Delay</guilabel> if you are "
"experiencing modem lockups. These settings make &kppp; pause a little just "
"before and just after sending the initialization string to your modem. The "
"<guilabel>Pre-Init Delay</guilabel> will by default also send a CR, unless "
"you have set it the delay interval to 0."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guibutton
#: global-settings.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid "Query Modem"
msgstr "Upit modema"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pushing this button will make &kppp; ask your modem to identify itself. On "
"success, your modems response will be displayed in a dialog. This may or may "
"not prove to be informative, depending on your modem."
msgstr ""
"Pritiskom na ovo dugme &kppp; će tražiti od modema da se identifikuje. Kada "
"uspije, odgovor modema bit će prikazan na dijalogu. Ovo može a i ne mora "
"biti informativno, u zavisnosti od Vašeg modema."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: global-settings.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid "Terminal"
msgstr "Terminal"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pushing the <guibutton>Terminal</guibutton> button will bring up a mini "
"terminal. You can use the mini terminal to test your modem and to experiment "
"with the negotiation protocol for initializing a ppp connection with your "
"<acronym>ISP</acronym>. You no longer need a terminal program such as "
"<application>minicom</application> or <application>Seyon</application>."
msgstr ""
"Pritiskom na dugme  <guibutton>Terminal</guibutton> će donijeti mini "
"terminal. Možete koristiti mini terminal da testirate Vaš modem i da "
"eksperimentišete sa pregovaranjem sa protokolom da inicijalizira ppp vezu sa "
"Vašim <acronym>ISP</acronym>.  Nećete trebati program terminala kao što je "
"<application>minicom</application> ili <application>Seyon</application>."

#. Tag: title
#: global-settings.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Graph tab"
msgstr "Graf"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: global-settings.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The <guilabel>Graph</guilabel> tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo> <guilabel>Graf</guilabel> kartica</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: global-settings.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The <guilabel>Graph</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase> <guilabel>Graf</guilabel> kartica</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:281
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The <guilabel>Graph</guilabel> tab</para>"
msgstr "<para> <guilabel>Graf</guilabel> kartica</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can set the colors used by the &kppp; graph. You can set different "
"colors for <guilabel>Background</guilabel>, <guilabel>Text</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Input bytes</guilabel> and <guilabel>Output bytes</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete postaviti boje koje koristi &kppp; graf. Možete postaviti "
"različite boje za <guilabel>Pozadinu</guilabel>, <guilabel>Tekst</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Ulazne bajte</guilabel> i <guilabel>Izlazne bajte</guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: global-settings.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Misc tab"
msgstr "Ostalo"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: global-settings.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The <guilabel>Misc</guilabel> tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Kartica <guilabel>Razno</guilabel></screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: global-settings.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The <guilabel>Misc</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Kartica<guilabel>Razno</guilabel> </phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The <guilabel>Misc</guilabel> tab</para>"
msgstr "<para>Kartica<guilabel>Razno</guilabel> </para>"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here are some options that don't really fit in with other sections, but can "
"be very useful nonetheless."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje se nalaze neke opcije koje se ne uklapaju u ostale sekcije, ali ipak "
"mogu biti korisne."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid "pppd Version"
msgstr "pppd verzija"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid "The version number of the pppd daemon on your system."
msgstr "Broj verzija pppd demona na Vašem sistemu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid "pppd Timeout"
msgstr "pppd Pauza"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kppp; will wait this amount of time after running the script and starting "
"<application>pppd</application> for <application>pppd</application> to "
"establish a valid <acronym>ppp</acronym> link before giving up and killing "
"<application>pppd</application>"
msgstr ""
"&kppp; će čekati ovoliko vremena nakon izvršavanja skripte i pokretanja "
"<application>pppd</application> za <application>pppd</application> da "
"uspostavi validnu <acronym>ppp</acronym> vezu prije odustajanja i ubijanja "
"<application>pppd</application>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dock into Panel on Connect"
msgstr "Spoji se na ploču kada je konektovano"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is chosen, &kppp; will dock into the panel where it will be "
"symbolized by a small animated icon. Use the <mousebutton>left</mousebutton> "
"mouse button on this icon to restore &kppp;'s window. The "
"<mousebutton>right</mousebutton> mouse button will open a popup menu that "
"offers to restore the window, show transfer statistics, or close the "
"connection. This option overrides <guilabel>Minimize Window on Connect</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko je odabrana ova opcija, &kppp; će se spojiti na ploču gdje će biti "
"simboliziran malom animiranom ikonom. Koristite <mousebutton>lijevo</"
"mousebutton> dugme miša da povratite &kppp;-ov prozor.  <mousebutton>Desno</"
"mousebutton> dugme miša će otvoriti iskačući meni koji nudi povratak "
"prozora, prikazuje statistiku prenosa, ili završava povezivanje. Ova opcija "
"nadglašava  <guilabel>Minimiziraj prozor kada je konektovano</guilabel>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic Redial on Disconnect"
msgstr "Automatsko ponovno povezivanje pri prekidu veze"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:344
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selectintg this will have &kppp; try to reconnect if you are disconnected."
msgstr ""
"Odabirom ovoga &kppp; će pokušati ponovo uspostaviti vezu ukoliko je "
"prekinuta."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show Clock on Caption"
msgstr "Pokaži sat u naslovu"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:351
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will have &kppp; display the time connected on the caption of the "
"&kppp; window, while you are online."
msgstr ""
"Ovim će &kppp; prikazati vrijeme veze u naslovu &kppp; prozora, dok budete "
"na vezi."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid "Disconnect on X-server shutdown"
msgstr "Prekini vezu pri gašenju X-servera"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Checking this will cause &kppp; to terminate the <acronym>ppp</acronym> "
"link, disconnect the modem, and terminate accounting in an orderly fashion, "
"when the X-server shuts down. This is useful if you are prone to forgetting "
"you are online, when you shut down the X-server, or if you simply don't want "
"to worry about manually disconnecting your session. If you don't want &kppp; "
"to hang up the modem on X-server exit, you should leave this checkbox empty. "
"Beware that if you have accounting enabled, and you leave this option turned "
"off, you will have an unterminated accounting entry in your logs, from each "
"time the X-server exits and &kppp; terminates."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:370
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quit on Disconnect"
msgstr "Izlaz pri prekidu veze"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If enabled, &kppp; will exit when you disconnect from the internet. If "
"disabled, &kppp; will stay open after disconnection."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ovo omogućeno, &kppp; će izaći kada prekinete vezu sa internetom. Ako "
"je onemogućeno, &kppp; će osati otvoren nakon prekida veze."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: global-settings.docbook:376
#, no-c-format
msgid "Minimize Window on Connect"
msgstr "Minimiziraj prozor kada je konektovano"

#. Tag: para
#: global-settings.docbook:378
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is chosen, &kppp; will be minimized after a connection is "
"established. The elapsed connection time will be shown in the taskbar."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ova opcija odabrana, &kppp; će biti minimiziran nakon što je "
"konekcija uspostavljena. Vrijeme koje je proteklo pri uspostavljanju "
"konekcije će biti prikazano u području obavjesti."
